<title>NEW ZEALAND: Strathmore initial buy-back price 34 cps.</title>
<headline>Strathmore initial buy-back price 34 cps.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strathmore Group said that effective from Thursday it was endeavouring to buy back its own shares at an initial offer price of 34 cents per share.</p>
<p>The shares are currently trading at 35 cents.</p>
<p>ANZ Securities is acting on behalf of Strathmore.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
